{"seq":2,"slug":"shared-logic","title":"共享逻辑篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"expect-actual-mechanism","title":"expect/actual 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic/expect-actual-mechanism","wordCount":744,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"multiplatform-networking","title":"跨平台网络与序列化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic/multiplatform-networking","wordCount":591,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"multiplatform-persistence","title":"跨平台持久化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic/multiplatform-persistence","wordCount":678,"readingTime":3}],"introMarkdown":"# 共享逻辑篇\n\n本章聚焦 KMP 项目中最有价值的部分——业务逻辑共享层的设计与实现。expect/actual 机制是编译时契约的核心，它让你在 commonMain 声明接口、在各平台提供原生实现；网络请求和序列化通过 Ktor + kotlinx.serialization 实现一次编写、多端运行；持久化层则借助 Room Multiplatform 和 DataStore 让数据库代码也能跨平台复用。\n\n本章的内容直接决定了一个 KMP 项目中 80% 以上代码的组织方式。\n"}